{
    "type": "minecraft:notice",
    "title": {
        "text": "感染阵营 循声者",
        "color": "dark_green",
        "bold": true
    },
    "external_title": {
        "text": ""
    },
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "minecraft:item",
            "item": {
                "id": "minecraft:echo_shard"
            },
            "show_decorations": false,
            "show_tooltip": false
        },
        {
            "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
            "contents": {
                "text": "循声者是母体吞噬普通感染体后，在编辑吞噬目标界面中改造出的特殊感染体。它保留普通感染体的追击职责，并额外拥有循声孢子。",
                "color": "gray"
            },
            "width": 240
        },
        {
            "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
            "contents": {
                "text": "技能：循声孢子",
                "color": "dark_green",
                "bold": true
            },
            "width": 240
        },
        {
            "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
            "contents": {
                "text": "右键释放后，循声者会探测周围移动的人类。按前后左右或跳跃的人类会暴露；潜行移动不会暴露，但潜行跳跃仍会被探测。孢子会追踪目标，命中后增加孢子污染值。",
                "color": "gray"
            },
            "width": 240
        },
        {
            "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
            "contents": {
                "text": "弱点：孢子可以被枪械击碎。没有人类暴露时，技能只进入短冷却；成功释放后会有短暂凝聚延迟。",
                "color": "dark_gray"
            },
            "width": 240
        }
    ],
    "inputs": [],
    "can_close_with_escape": true,
    "action": {
        "label": {
            "text": "返回"
        },
        "action": {
            "type": "minecraft:show_dialog",
            "dialog": "escape_island:profession/zombie_menu"
        }
    }
}
